        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hires Root Beer, Vernors Ginger Ale\n- People: James Vernor, Charles Elmer Hires\n- Places: Detroit, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania\n- Roles: pharmacists, Quaker\n\nFacts:\n- Vernors Ginger Ale dates to 1866.\n- James Vernor created Vernors Ginger Ale in 1866.\n- James Vernor was a pharmacist in Detroit.\n- Charles Elmer Hires was a Quaker pharmacist from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.\n- Charles Elmer Hires formulated the beverage Hires Root Beer.\n- Only Vernors Ginger Ale, dating to 1866, is older than Hires Root Beer.",
